00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.910
I am a Caucasian female with
shoulder length brown hair,

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:18.399
blue eyes, and a
black suit jacket.

00:04:18.399 --> 00:04:19.899
Thank you for being here.

00:04:19.899 --> 00:04:22.480
Next, we have my friend,
comedian, actor, writer,

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.860
Maysoon Zayid.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.080
As a comedian, Maysoon
has toured extensively

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.430
at home and abroad.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.580
She had the most viewed
