00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.140
and is the author of
a best selling memoir,

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.810
Find Another Dream.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.630
She appeared alongside
Adam Sandler,

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.360
