00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.690
I want to describe
myself to the audience.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.880
I look like the lost Kardashian.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:01.030
I have cinnamon skin,
long black hair,

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:04.690
and I'm wearing a Prince
Purple Rain Calvin Klein

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:07.750
